_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["community","discussion","feedback","hacktoberfest","open-source","rails","ruby"],"visibility":"public","forks":4153,"open_issues":555,"watchers":22543,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nDon't know if it's on purpose but when I click on my avatar the navbar gets smaller on the sides (see screenshot) because the `top` property is not the same as the navbar height.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n\r\n1. Click on your avatar in the navbar.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe `top` property` of the background should be the same as the the navbar height.\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\nBefore:\r\n![screenshot from 2018-11-28 13-18-17](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5699145/49151607-c1b9b680-f310-11e8-86b9-adbcb35063a9.png)\r\n\r\nAfter modifying class:\r\n![screenshot from 2018-11-28 13-18-40](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5699145/49151621-cbdbb500-f310-11e8-9d3d-8ad09ef0ffd3.png)\r\n\r\n**Desktop (please complete the following information):**\r\n\r\n- OS: Ubuntu 18.04\r\n- Chrome v.70.0.3538.110 (Official Build) (64-bit)\r\n\r\n**How to fix it?**\r\nThe class `.menubg` needs to be changed to `top: 49px` in `app/assets/stylesheets/top-bar.scss`.\r\n```css\r\n.menubg {\r\n    ...\r\n    top: 49px;\r\n   ...\r\n}\r\n```\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/1213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/1213/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"Link2Twenty","id":3534427,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzQ0Mjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3534427?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Link2Twenty","html